{"id": "zoo-loan-and-ledger", "title": "Zoo: $937K undocumented, no fee plan, a $2.5M loan whose papers aren't public", "seconds": 146.4, "voice": "elevenlabs:iPYqcpY8j8Ap4jUf28I3", "narrator": "Michael", "tempo": 1.2, "made": "2026-11-24", "key": "39c37520338bfb33", "words": 420, "beats": [{"scene": "open", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["story[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "San Francisco owns its Zoo. A nonprofit, the Zoological Society, runs it.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 5.81, "shot": "b0", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "cityhall", "name": "City of San Francisco", "sub": "owns the Zoo"}, {"art": "money", "name": "$4 million a year", "sub": "management fee"}, {"art": "contract", "name": "San Francisco Zoological Society", "sub": "runs it since 1993"}], "kicker": "Who runs the Zoo"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.84, 1.33, 1.62, 2.37, 2.87, 3.75, 3.87, 4.47, 5.24, 5.44]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["story[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The City pays it 4 million dollars a year.", "t0": 5.93, "t1": 8.34, "shot": "b0", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "cityhall", "name": "City of San Francisco", "sub": "owns the Zoo"}, {"art": "money", "name": "$4 million a year", "sub": "management fee"}, {"art": "contract", "name": "San Francisco Zoological Society", "sub": "runs it since 1993"}], "kicker": "Who runs the Zoo"}, "emph": ["4 million"], "wt": [0.0, 0.09, 0.39, 0.6, 0.74, 1.0, 1.4, 1.72, 1.83]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["story[1]"], "text": "In May 2026, the Board’s own auditor, the Budget and Legislative Analyst, checked the books.", "t0": 8.46, "t1": 14.54, "shot": "b1", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "magnifier", "label": "A Board audit", "sub": "May 1, 2026"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.27, 0.51, 0.77, 1.82, 1.92, 2.32, 2.53, 3.22, 3.31, 3.63, 3.78, 4.32, 5.1, 5.35, 5.48]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["oneLine", "established[1]"], "text": "It found payments to one firm that the Society couldn’t explain. How much?", "t0": 14.66, "t1": 19.75, "shot": "b2", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "question", "label": "One firm, no paperwork", "sub": "MK Think"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.07, 0.34, 0.8, 0.94, 1.16, 1.45, 1.58, 1.7, 2.24, 2.5, 3.61, 4.03]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["oneLine", "established[1]"], "text": "936,967.95 dollars.", "t0": 19.75, "t1": 25.83, "shot": "b3", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$936,967.95", "label": "paid to MK Think, 2019 to 2021"}, "emph": ["936,967.95"], "wt": [0.04, 0.63, 0.93, 1.54, 2.23, 2.63, 2.94, 3.61, 4.3, 4.85, 5.43]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[4]"], "text": "Those are official findings. The Society accepted all 37 fixes aimed at it.", "t0": 26.35, "t1": 31.62, "shot": "b4", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "gavel", "label": "Official findings", "sub": "all 37 recommendations accepted"}, "emph": ["37"], "wt": [0.0, 0.28, 0.52, 0.94, 1.83, 2.14, 2.66, 3.13, 3.32, 3.96, 4.4, 4.72, 4.86]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "rank", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "First, that firm. Three payments, for the Madagascar project and other work. What did the money buy?", "t0": 31.84, "t1": 38.48, "shot": "b5", "visual": {"type": "rank", "label": "Payments to MK Think", "rows": [["FY2020-21", "624293"], ["FY2019-20", "246339"], ["FY2019-20", "66336"]]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.45, 0.89, 1.36, 2.08, 2.69, 2.91, 3.01, 3.56, 4.08, 4.27, 4.56, 5.08, 5.59, 5.71, 5.79, 6.06]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1].why", "notEstablished[0]"], "text": "The Society couldn’t show what MK Think delivered, or how it was picked.", "t0": 38.48, "t1": 43.0, "shot": "b6", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "could not document the services or the selection"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.85, 1.28, 1.66, 1.83, 2.1, 2.38, 2.71, 3.57, 3.71, 3.88, 3.97, 4.17]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1].why", "notEstablished[0]"], "text": "That’s not a finding of overbilling. It’s missing paper.", "t0": 43.12, "t1": 46.28, "shot": "b6", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "could not document the services or the selection"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.34, 0.45, 0.77, 0.88, 1.77, 2.32, 2.69]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[2]"], "text": "Second, construction. The Recreation and Park Commission must approve building work first.", "t0": 46.5, "t1": 51.51, "shot": "b7", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "housing", "label": "Building work", "kicker": "The second finding", "sub": "fiscal 2019-20 to 2024-25"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.46, 1.47, 2.12, 2.62, 2.72, 2.96, 3.31, 3.51, 3.84, 4.19, 4.47]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[2]"], "text": "How much went ahead without that on paper?", "t0": 51.63, "t1": 53.9, "shot": "b7", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "housing", "label": "Building work", "kicker": "The second finding", "sub": "fiscal 2019-20 to 2024-25"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.38, 0.54, 0.8, 1.13, 1.34, 1.49]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[2]"], "text": "At least 12 million dollars.", "t0": 53.9, "t1": 56.72, "shot": "b8", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$12 million", "label": "at least, without documented approval"}, "emph": ["At"], "wt": [0.04, 0.55, 0.99, 1.68, 2.15]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[3].why", "established[10]"], "text": "Why does the City get a say? It owns the land, and everything built on it.", "t0": 57.24, "t1": 61.57, "shot": "b9", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "the City owns the land and the improvements"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.35, 0.52, 0.82, 0.95, 1.07, 1.61, 2.1, 2.35, 2.53, 2.98, 3.23, 3.76, 4.03, 4.18]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[3].why", "established[10]"], "text": "Later, the Society sent more detail for 2018 to 2025.", "t0": 61.69, "t1": 65.46, "shot": "b9", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "the City owns the land and the improvements"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.38, 0.48, 0.88, 1.14, 1.35, 1.73, 1.86, 2.07, 2.54, 2.79, 3.0]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[3]"], "text": "Third, that yearly fee. What does the 4 million pay for?", "t0": 65.68, "t1": 69.18, "shot": "b10", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "money", "label": "The $4 million fee", "kicker": "The third finding", "sub": "contract 1000005882"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.37, 0.54, 1.0, 1.51, 1.91, 2.05, 2.19, 2.39, 2.73, 2.96]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[3]"], "text": "There’s no plan or budget that says.", "t0": 69.18, "t1": 71.24, "shot": "b10", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "money", "label": "The $4 million fee", "kicker": "The third finding", "sub": "contract 1000005882"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.43, 0.58, 0.89, 1.03, 1.34, 1.53]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[2].why", "notEstablished[1]"], "text": "So nobody can show it isn’t paying for costs the City wouldn’t allow.", "t0": 71.36, "t1": 74.91, "shot": "b11", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "nobody can show it did not"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.5, 0.69, 0.89, 1.03, 1.28, 1.55, 1.74, 2.23, 2.43, 2.67, 2.99]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[2].why", "notEstablished[1]"], "text": "Not that it did. No one can check.", "t0": 75.03, "t1": 77.36, "shot": "b11", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "nobody can show it did not"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.27, 0.47, 1.0, 1.58, 1.78, 1.99]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["story[2]", "established[5]"], "text": "Then a twist.", "t0": 77.58, "t1": 78.88, "shot": "b12", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "money", "label": "A City loan", "kicker": "Then a loan", "sub": "authorized May 19, 2026"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.42, 0.71]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["story[2]", "established[5]"], "text": "As the audit ended, the Society asked the City for a loan, to cover its losses.", "t0": 79.0, "t1": 83.87, "shot": "b12", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "money", "label": "A City loan", "kicker": "Then a loan", "sub": "authorized May 19, 2026"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.32, 0.67, 1.48, 1.6, 2.11, 2.35, 2.45, 2.7, 2.83, 2.95, 3.47, 3.78, 4.05, 4.28]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["story[2]", "established[5]"], "text": "How much did the Board approve?", "t0": 83.99, "t1": 85.82, "shot": "b12", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "money", "label": "A City loan", "kicker": "Then a loan", "sub": "authorized May 19, 2026"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.09, 0.28, 0.4, 0.49, 0.78]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["established[5]", "story[2]"], "text": "Up to 8.5 million dollars.", "t0": 85.82, "t1": 88.4, "shot": "b13", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$8.5 million", "label": "up to, May 19, 2026", "sub": "$6.5 million in stages, plus a $2 million reserve"}, "emph": ["Up"], "wt": [0.04, 0.37, 0.46, 0.76, 1.19, 1.41, 1.89]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["established[5]", "suspicious[2].why"], "text": "How does the Zoo pay it back?", "t0": 88.92, "t1": 90.85, "shot": "b14", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "cityhall", "name": "City", "sub": "lends the money"}, {"art": "contract", "name": "Zoological Society", "sub": "uses it now"}, {"art": "money", "name": "Smaller fee", "sub": "from early 2028"}], "kicker": "How it gets paid back"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.33, 0.47, 0.78, 1.03, 1.18]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["established[5]", "suspicious[2].why"], "text": "From early 2028, the City pays it a smaller monthly fee.", "t0": 90.85, "t1": 94.78, "shot": "b14", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "cityhall", "name": "City", "sub": "lends the money"}, {"art": "contract", "name": "Zoological Society", "sub": "uses it now"}, {"art": "money", "name": "Smaller fee", "sub": "from early 2028"}], "kicker": "How it gets paid back"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.43, 0.69, 0.96, 1.8, 1.91, 2.17, 2.41, 2.49, 2.58, 3.05, 3.55]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["established[5]", "suspicious[2].why"], "text": "So the loan comes out of the fee nobody can track.", "t0": 94.9, "t1": 97.44, "shot": "b14", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "cityhall", "name": "City", "sub": "lends the money"}, {"art": "contract", "name": "Zoological Society", "sub": "uses it now"}, {"art": "money", "name": "Smaller fee", "sub": "from early 2028"}], "kicker": "How it gets paid back"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.27, 0.58, 0.82, 0.89, 0.97, 1.15, 1.47, 1.92, 2.13]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["established[6]"], "text": "And when it first came up, on May 6, the loan papers weren’t even drafted.", "t0": 97.56, "t1": 101.45, "shot": "b15", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "no collateral secures the loan"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.05, 0.2, 0.32, 0.54, 0.8, 1.13, 1.27, 1.49, 2.3, 2.41, 2.67, 2.98, 3.18, 3.35]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["established[6]"], "text": "No collateral backs it.", "t0": 101.57, "t1": 103.64, "shot": "b15", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "no collateral secures the loan"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.25, 0.79, 1.11]}, {"scene": "lead5", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[8]"], "text": "Now our own lead. No authority has looked at this part.", "t0": 103.86, "t1": 107.09, "shot": "b16", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "Loans Issued By City", "kicker": "The open lead", "sub": "PO 000104826302"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.28, 0.48, 0.69, 1.23, 1.67, 2.08, 2.25, 2.47, 2.59, 2.77]}, {"scene": "lead5", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[8]"], "text": "City data shows money paid on this loan. How much?", "t0": 107.21, "t1": 110.08, "shot": "b16", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "Loans Issued By City", "kicker": "The open lead", "sub": "PO 000104826302"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.25, 0.51, 0.77, 0.99, 1.22, 1.31, 1.52, 2.03, 2.4]}, {"scene": "lead5", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["amount", "established[8]"], "text": "2.5 million dollars.", "t0": 110.08, "t1": 112.35, "shot": "b17", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$2,500,000", "label": "paid, fiscal 2026-27", "sub": "the planned first release"}, "emph": ["2.5"], "wt": [0.04, 0.65, 0.95, 1.11, 1.52]}, {"scene": "lead5", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0].why", "established[9]"], "text": "The Board wanted the signed papers filed within 30 days.", "t0": 112.87, "t1": 115.69, "shot": "b18", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "DRAFT Loan Terms"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.06, 0.32, 0.57, 0.66, 1.01, 1.4, 1.72, 1.99, 2.31]}, {"scene": "lead5", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0].why", "established[9]"], "text": "On November 12, 2026, the file still had only drafts.", "t0": 115.81, "t1": 120.07, "shot": "b18", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "DRAFT Loan Terms"}, "emph": ["only drafts"], "wt": [0.0, 0.08, 0.45, 1.07, 1.28, 2.48, 2.63, 2.89, 3.15, 3.3, 3.6]}, {"scene": "lead5", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[2]", "suspicious[0].why"], "text": "It may be signed and just not posted.", "t0": 120.19, "t1": 122.44, "shot": "b19", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["Whether the agreement was signed, and when"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.3, 0.44, 0.82, 0.97, 1.3, 1.73]}, {"scene": "lead5", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[2]", "suspicious[0].why"], "text": "But until it’s public, no one can check what the Zoo had to do first.", "t0": 122.56, "t1": 125.85, "shot": "b19", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["Whether the agreement was signed, and when"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.06, 0.3, 0.47, 1.21, 1.38, 1.53, 1.72, 1.96, 2.04, 2.19, 2.39, 2.57, 2.66, 2.82]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[3]", "notEstablished[4]"], "text": "The records don’t show the day the money moved, or whether the City accepted the Zoo’s October work.", "t0": 126.07, "t1": 130.94, "shot": "b20", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["The date the $2.5 million was paid", "Whether the City accepted the October 1 work"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.05, 0.43, 0.64, 0.83, 1.0, 1.23, 1.37, 1.6, 2.44, 2.57, 2.82, 2.92, 3.18, 3.57, 3.72, 3.99, 4.48]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "settle", "ref": ["next[0]", "next[3]"], "text": "What would settle it? The signed loan agreement, with its date.", "t0": 131.06, "t1": 134.76, "shot": "b21", "visual": {"type": "settle", "cards": [{"who": "", "what": "The signed loan agreement, with its date"}, {"who": "", "what": "The invoices behind the $936,967.95"}], "focus": 0}, "wt": [0.0, 0.21, 0.48, 0.81, 1.15, 1.55, 1.96, 2.27, 2.99, 3.13, 3.3]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "settle", "ref": ["next[0]", "next[3]"], "text": "And the invoices behind the MK Think payments.", "t0": 134.88, "t1": 137.61, "shot": "b21", "visual": {"type": "settle", "cards": [{"who": "", "what": "The signed loan agreement, with its date"}, {"who": "", "what": "The invoices behind the $936,967.95"}], "focus": 0}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.27, 0.85, 1.17, 1.4, 1.72, 2.05]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "status", "ref": ["status", "established[7]"], "text": "The first 2.5 million came from a park land fund. No authority has found money missing.", "t0": 137.73, "t1": 143.01, "shot": "b22", "visual": {"type": "status"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.45, 0.66, 0.96, 1.12, 1.53, 1.83, 1.97, 2.05, 2.32, 2.6, 3.18, 3.71, 4.17, 4.31, 4.58, 4.85]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "end", "ref": ["end"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 143.13, "t1": 145.5, "shot": "b23", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.22, 0.67, 0.81, 1.11, 1.17, 1.29, 1.61, 1.9]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"open": "The question", "lead1": "Finding 1 · $936,967.95", "lead2": "Finding 2 · $12 million built", "lead3": "Finding 3 · the $4 million fee", "lead4": "The loan · up to $8.5 million", "lead5": "Lead · drafts only", "close": "Where it stands"}, "look": "dossier", "hook": "timeline"}